{"seq":2,"slug":"single-spa-framework","title":"Single-SPA 与运行时编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/implementation/single-spa-framework","wordCount":841,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"single-spa-与运行时编排\">Single-SPA 与运行时编排</h1><p>Single-SPA 是微前端领域存活最久的框架（2018 年至今），其核心定位是「顶层路由器」——它不关心你用什么框架、什么打包器，只在路由匹配时下载并执行对应应用的生命周期函数。2026 年已到 6.x 版本，文档标注为 <code>Version: 6.x</code>，社区生态包括 <code>single-spa-react</code>、<code>single-spa-vue</code>、<code>single-spa-angular</code>（已发布 21.x 对齐 Angular 21）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Single-SPA 的心智模型极其简洁：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Browser as 浏览器 URL&#10;    participant Root as Root Config&#10;    participant AppA as 子应用 A&#10;    participant AppB as 子应用 B&#10;&#10;    Browser-&gt;&gt;Root: URL 变化 /product&#10;    Root-&gt;&gt;Root: 遍历 activityFunction&#10;    Root-&gt;&gt;AppA: bootstrap() → mount()&#10;    Note over AppA: 渲染 Product 页面&#10;    Browser-&gt;&gt;Root: URL 变化 /order&#10;    Root-&gt;&gt;AppA: unmount()&#10;    Root-&gt;&gt;AppB: bootstrap() → mount()&#10;    Note over AppB: 渲染 Order 页面\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Browser as 浏览器 URL\n    participant Root as Root Config\n    participant AppA as 子应用 A\n    participant AppB as 子应用 B\n\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;Root: URL 变化 /product\n    Root-&gt;&gt;Root: 遍历 activityFunction\n    Root-&gt;&gt;AppA: bootstrap() → mount()\n    Note over AppA: 渲染 Product 页面\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;Root: URL 变化 /order\n    Root-&gt;&gt;AppA: unmount()\n    Root-&gt;&gt;AppB: bootstrap() → mount()\n    Note over AppB: 渲染 Order 页面</pre><p>三个关键角色：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>技术要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Root Config</td>\n<td>注册应用、决定何时激活</td>\n<td>纯 JS，不用框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Application</td>\n<td>渲染 UI、管理内部状态</td>\n<td>暴露 bootstrap/mount/unmount</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Utility Module</td>\n<td>跨应用共享逻辑</td>\n<td>无生命周期，按需导入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"生命周期协议\">生命周期协议</h2><p>每个子应用必须导出三个（可选四个）生命周期函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// product-app/src/single-spa-entry.ts&#10;import { createApp, App } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;import ProductApp from &#39;./App.vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;let app: App | null = null;&#10;&#10;export function bootstrap() {&#10;  // 一次性初始化（仅在第一次加载时调用）&#10;  return Promise.resolve();&#10;}&#10;&#10;export function mount(props: { domElement: HTMLElement }) {&#10;  app = createApp(ProductApp);&#10;  app.mount(props.domElement);&#10;  return Promise.resolve();&#10;}&#10;&#10;export function unmount() {&#10;  app?.unmount();&#10;  app = null;&#10;  return Promise.resolve();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// product-app/src/single-spa-entry.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createApp, App } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ProductApp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './App.vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> App</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bootstrap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 一次性初始化（仅在第一次加载时调用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">props</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">domElement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  app </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createApp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ProductApp);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(props.domElement);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> unmount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  app?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unmount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  app </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"import-maps-与-systemjs\">Import Maps 与 SystemJS</h2><p>Single-SPA 推荐使用浏览器原生 Import Maps（或 SystemJS polyfill）管理模块加载，而非打包器插件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- index.html --&gt;&#10;&lt;script type=&quot;importmap&quot;&gt;&#10;  {&#10;    &quot;imports&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;react&quot;: &quot;https://cdn.example.com/react@19/esm/index.js&quot;,&#10;      &quot;react-dom&quot;: &quot;https://cdn.example.com/react-dom@19/esm/index.js&quot;,&#10;      &quot;@product/app&quot;: &quot;https://product.example.com/entry.js&quot;,&#10;      &quot;@order/app&quot;: &quot;https://order.example.com/entry.js&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- index.html --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">script</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"importmap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    \"imports\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      \"react\": \"https://cdn.example.com/react@19/esm/index.js\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      \"react-dom\": \"https://cdn.example.com/react-dom@19/esm/index.js\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      \"@product/app\": \"https://product.example.com/entry.js\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      \"@order/app\": \"https://order.example.com/entry.js\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">script</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种方式的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>零构建时耦合</strong>：子应用独立打包，只需暴露 ESM 入口</li>\n<li><strong>版本管理集中化</strong>：更新 import map 即可全局切换依赖版本</li>\n<li><strong>与 CDN 天然配合</strong>：每个 URL 可以独立缓存和灰度</li>\n</ul>\n<p>劣势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无自动 TypeScript 类型共享（MF 2.0 的优势领域）</li>\n<li>需要额外处理 CSS 加载（通常配合构建时提取）</li>\n<li>调试时 source map 需要跨域配置</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与-module-federation-的互补关系\">与 Module Federation 的互补关系</h2><p>Single-SPA 和 Module Federation 不是竞争关系，而是在不同层面解决问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Single-SPA</th>\n<th>Module Federation</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心功能</td>\n<td>应用级路由编排</td>\n<td>模块级代码共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粒度</td>\n<td>整个应用的生命周期</td>\n<td>单个组件/hook</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架依赖</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>需要打包器插件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享策略</td>\n<td>Import Maps / externals</td>\n<td>内置 shared 协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td>手动维护</td>\n<td>自动 .d.ts 生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>多框架混合编排</td>\n<td>同技术栈的模块共享</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实际中，大型系统可能同时使用两者：Single-SPA 做应用级路由编排，Module Federation 做应用内的模块共享。</p>\n<h2 id=\"qiankun-与-single-spa-的关系\">qiankun 与 Single-SPA 的关系</h2><p>qiankun 本质上是 Single-SPA 的增强封装，在其基础上增加了：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>JS 沙箱</strong>：Proxy 代理隔离全局变量</li>\n<li><strong>CSS 隔离</strong>：<code>experimentalStyleIsolation</code> / <code>strictStyleIsolation</code></li>\n<li><strong>HTML Entry</strong>：直接加载子应用的 HTML 文件，自动解析资源</li>\n<li><strong>预加载</strong>：空闲时提前加载子应用资源</li>\n<li><strong>全局状态</strong>：<code>initGlobalState</code> API</li>\n</ol>\n<p>从架构上看，qiankun = Single-SPA（路由编排）+ 沙箱（隔离）+ HTML Entry（便捷接入）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战-多框架并存配置\">实战：多框架并存配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// root-config.ts&#10;import { registerApplication, start } from &#39;single-spa&#39;;&#10;&#10;// React 19 子应用&#10;registerApplication({&#10;  name: &#39;dashboard&#39;,&#10;  app: () =&gt; System.import(&#39;@dashboard/app&#39;),&#10;  activeWhen: [&#39;/dashboard&#39;],&#10;});&#10;&#10;// Vue 3 子应用&#10;registerApplication({&#10;  name: &#39;settings&#39;,&#10;  app: () =&gt; System.import(&#39;@settings/app&#39;),&#10;  activeWhen: [&#39;/settings&#39;],&#10;});&#10;&#10;// Angular 21 子应用（始终激活的导航栏）&#10;registerApplication({&#10;  name: &#39;navbar&#39;,&#10;  app: () =&gt; System.import(&#39;@navbar/app&#39;),&#10;  activeWhen: () =&gt; true,&#10;});&#10;&#10;start({ urlRerouteOnly: true });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// root-config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { registerApplication, start } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'single-spa'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// React 19 子应用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">registerApplication</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dashboard'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> System.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@dashboard/app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  activeWhen: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/dashboard'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Vue 3 子应用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">registerApplication</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'settings'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> System.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@settings/app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  activeWhen: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/settings'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Angular 21 子应用（始终激活的导航栏）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">registerApplication</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'navbar'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> System.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@navbar/app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  activeWhen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ urlRerouteOnly: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"2026-年-single-spa-生态现状\">2026 年 Single-SPA 生态现状</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Version 6.x 稳定运行</strong>，API 无重大变更</li>\n<li><code>single-spa-angular</code> 已发布 21.x（锁步 Angular 大版本）</li>\n<li>社区维护转向 <code>@single-spa-community</code> scope</li>\n<li>与 Import Maps 的配合是 2026 年的推荐接入方式</li>\n<li>不再推荐 SystemJS（浏览器原生 Import Maps 已获广泛支持）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Single-SPA 是「路由级编排器」，不做隔离、不做共享——极致简洁</li>\n<li>生命周期协议（bootstrap/mount/unmount）是子应用与 Shell 的唯一契约</li>\n<li>Import Maps 是 2026 年推荐的模块加载方式</li>\n<li>与 MF 2.0 互补：SPA 做应用编排，MF 做模块共享</li>\n<li>qiankun 是 Single-SPA 的增强封装，适合国内团队快速上手</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 下一篇：<a href=\"web-components-approach\">Web Components 与边缘组合</a> — 去框架化的组合方案</li>\n<li>本 hub 前一篇：<a href=\"module-federation\">Module Federation 2.0 实战</a> — 模块级共享方案的深入讲解</li>\n<li>跨 hub 参考：<a href=\"../build-tooling-bundlers/foundations/module-systems\">构建工具 hub — 模块系统</a> — ES Modules 与 Import Maps 的底层机制</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Single-SPA 与运行时编排","id":"single-spa-与运行时编排"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"生命周期协议","id":"生命周期协议"},{"level":2,"text":"Import Maps 与 SystemJS","id":"import-maps-与-systemjs"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Module Federation 的互补关系","id":"与-module-federation-的互补关系"},{"level":2,"text":"qiankun 与 Single-SPA 的关系","id":"qiankun-与-single-spa-的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"实战：多框架并存配置","id":"实战-多框架并存配置"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年 Single-SPA 生态现状","id":"2026-年-single-spa-生态现状"},{"level"